{"type":"message","id":"e7bbd496","parentId":"c7e4460c","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:17:53.423Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, found two files: ./config/urls-v2.json and ./config/urls.json, both under the daily-news-crawler directory. Now I need to read both files to check their content, see which one has the 17 government website URLs list, and get their full content.\n\nFirst let's read urls.json, then urls-v2.json. Let's start with the first one: /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/urls.json.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pue1u219pmxlqqge40gn41s7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/urls.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425868630}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e3cd83a","parentId":"e7bbd496","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:17:53.428Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_pue1u219pmxlqqge40gn41s7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"description\": \"政府网站新闻政策监控列表\",\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2025-03-13\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_hrss\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\",\n      \"category\": \"社保人社\",\n      \"url\": \"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_dpc\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市发展和改革委员会\",\n      \"category\": \"发改政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://dpc.xm.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item, .news_item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a, .news_title\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time, .news_date\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_sti\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门科学技术局\",\n      \"category\": \"科技政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://sti.xm.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"most\",\n      \"name\": \"中华人民共和国科学技术部\",\n      \"category\": \"国家科技政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.most.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item, .content-list li\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_sme\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市中小企业服务中心\",\n      \"category\": \"中小企业服务\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.xmsme.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"miit\",\n      \"name\": \"中华人民共和国工业和信息化部\",\n      \"category\": \"国家工信政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.miit.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item, .content-list li\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ndrc\",\n      \"name\": \"中华人民共和国国家发展和改革委员会\",\n      \"category\": \"国家发改政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.ndrc.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mnr\",\n      \"name\": \"自然资源部门户网站\",\n      \"category\": \"自然资源政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.mnr.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fj_kjt\",\n      \"name\": \"福建省科技厅\",\n      \"category\": \"省级科技政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://kjt.fujian.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_jsj\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市建设局\",\n      \"category\": \"建设政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://js.xm.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_gxj\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市工业和信息化局\",\n      \"category\": \"工信政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://gxj.xm.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_gh\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门工会网-厦门市总工会\",\n      \"category\": \"工会政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.xmgh.org/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fj_jyt\",\n      \"name\": \"公告公示_信息公开_福建省教育厅\",\n      \"category\": \"教育政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://jyt.fujian.gov.cn/xxgk/gggs/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_siming\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市思明区科技和信息化局-首页\",\n      \"category\": \"区级科技政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.siming.gov.cn/gbmzl/kjhxxhj/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_software\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市软件行业协会 - 新闻中心\",\n      \"category\": \"行业协会\",\n      \"url\": \"http://www.xmsia.cn/Pages/Home/NewsList.aspx?classId=3\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_torch\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门火炬高技术产业开发区-信息公开-法定主动公开内容-管理服务\",\n      \"category\": \"开发区政策\",\n      \"url\": \"http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_data\",\n      \"name\": \"通知公告-厦门市数据管理局\",\n      \"category\": \"数据管理政策\",\n      \"url\": \"https://as.xm.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgg/\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"list\": \".news-list li, .list-item\",\n        \"title\": \".title, a\",\n        \"date\": \".date, .time\",\n        \"link\": \"a\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773425873427}}
{"type":"message","id":"5c8dd2a5","parentId":"6e3cd83a","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:17:58.130Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, that's urls.json. Let's count the sources: let's see, 1. xm_hrss, 2. xm_dpc, 3. xm_sti, 4. most, 5. xm_sme, 6. miit,7. ndrc,8. mnr,9. fj_kjt,10. xm_jsj,11. xm_gxj,12. xm_gh,13. fj_jyt,14. xm_siming,15. xm_software,16. xm_torch,17. xm_data. Oh right, exactly 17 entries! That's the one. Now let's check the other file, urls-v2.json, to see what's in that too, just in case.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_z82v5i3mji3dhwruxodemqtk","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/urls-v2.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425873428}}
{"type":"message","id":"0628dccc","parentId":"5c8dd2a5","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:17:58.142Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_z82v5i3mji3dhwruxodemqtk","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": \"2.0\",\n  \"description\": \"政府网站新闻政策监控列表 - 更新选择器\",\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2025-03-14\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_hrss\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\",\n      \"url\": \"http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\",\n      \"selectors\": [\n        \".news-list li\",\n        \".list-item\",\n        \".news-item\",\n        \"ul.list li\",\n        \".content-list li\"\n      ],\n      \"titleSelector\": \".title, a, .news-title, h3, h4\",\n      \"dateSelector\": \".date, .time, .news-date, span\",\n      \"linkSelector\": \"a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"xm_dpc\",\n      \"name\": \"厦门市发展和改革委员会\",\n      \"url\": \"http://dpc.xm.gov.cn/\",\n      \"selectors\": [\n        \".news-list li\",\n        \".list-item\",\n        \".news_item\",\n        \".content-list li\"\n      ],\n      \"titleSelector\": \".title, a, .news_title, h3\",\n      \"dateSelector\": \".date, .time, .news_date\",\n      \"linkSelector\": \"a\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773425878139}}
{"type":"message","id":"e565c627","parentId":"0628dccc","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:18:07.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nOkay, so urls-v2.json only has 2 entries, it's an updated version but only has 2 sites so far, not the full 17. So the file we are looking for is urls.json. Let's summarize:\n\nFound two config files under /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/:\n1. urls.json: Contains exactly 17 government website URL list (the required one). Full content we already read.\n2. urls-v2.json: Only has 2 entries, is a partial updated version, not the full 17 list.\n\nWait let me confirm the count again for urls.json: yes 17 sources, right? Let's count again: 1.厦门市人社局,2.厦门市发改委,3.厦门市科技局,4.国家科技部,5.厦门市中小企业服务中心,6.国家工信部,7.国家发改委,8.自然资源部,9.福建省科技厅,10.厦门市建设局,11.厦门市工信局,12.厦门市总工会,13.福建省教育厅,14.思明区科技和信息化局,15.厦门市软件行业协会,16.厦门火炬高新区,17.厦门市数据管理局. Yes exactly 17. Perfect.\n\nNow I can report the results back to the main agent.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 搜索结果\n找到包含17个政府网站URL列表的配置文件如下：\n\n### 1. 文件路径：`/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/urls.json`\n**内容摘要**：\n- 版本：1.0\n- 描述：政府网站新闻政策监控列表\n- 更新时间：2025-03-13\n- 共包含17个政府/官方网站数据源，覆盖国家/省/市/区各级人社、发改、科技、工信、建设、教育等部门，以及行业协会、开发区管委会等机构，每个站点均配置了对应的爬取规则（列表选择器、标题选择器、日期选择器、链接选择器）。\n\n### 2. 文件路径：`/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/projects/daily-news-crawler/config/urls-v2.json`\n**说明**：该文件为新版配置文件，目前仅包含2个站点配置，尚未完成全部17个站点的迁移，不包含完整的17个政府网站URL列表。\n\n---\n完整的17个政府网站URL列表已在`urls.json`中全部收录，如需获取具体站点URL或规则可进一步提取。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773425878141}}
